---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import FactoryPhoto from './FactoryPhoto.astro';
import FactoryIllustration from './FactoryIllustration.astro';
import RfqPanel from './RfqPanel.astro';
import {factoryQuote,inspectionStages,measurementMethods,orderRecords,qualificationFields,qualificationHref,reportHref} from '../data/factoryEditorial';
import '../styles/factory-design.css';
const quoteHref=factoryQuote('quality');
---
<Layout title="Quality Control for Custom CNC Parts" description="LZZ is ISO 9001 certified. Review feature-based measurement methods, first-article and production checks, inspection reports and supplier qualification documents." cta={false} headerQuoteHref={quoteHref}>
<article class="factory-design fd-quality">
 <div class="fd-wrap">
  <section class="fd-quality-hero" aria-labelledby="quality-title"><header><h1 id="quality-title">Quality starts with your drawing</h1><p class="fd-lead">Define what matters. Agree how it will be checked.</p><p>For custom CNC parts, critical features, measurement methods and acceptance criteria belong in the order before machining begins.</p><nav class="fd-actions" aria-label="Quality review"><a class="fd-link" href="#inspection-records">Review the inspection records</a><a class="fd-link" href="#quality-management">Supplier qualification</a></nav><p class="fd-certification">LZZ is ISO 9001 certified. Request the current certificate and scope for your supplier review.</p></header><FactoryPhoto id="cmm-room" caption="Coordinate measuring machine · original LZZ inspection photograph" class="fd-quality-hero-photo" eager sizes="(max-width:760px) 300px, 380px"/></section>
  <section class="fd-section" id="inspection-equipment" aria-labelledby="methods-title">
   <header class="fd-section-head"><h2 id="methods-title">Match the method to the feature</h2><p>The drawing establishes datums and limits. The part's geometry, support and material condition determine how those requirements can be measured.</p></header>
   <div class="fd-method-intro"><FactoryIllustration kind="measurement"/><div><h3>Make the measurement conditions explicit</h3><p>Identify the reference faces, protected surfaces and the condition in which the part will be measured. Agree whether acceptance applies before or after finishing.</p><p>Request the instrument range and calibration evidence required by your qualification process.</p><a class="fd-link" href="/resources/technical-guides/critical-features-cnc-drawing/">Mark critical drawing features</a></div></div>
   <table class="fd-table fd-method-table" id="measurement-methods"><thead><tr><th scope="col">Feature to review</th><th scope="col">Method</th><th scope="col">Agree for the drawing</th></tr></thead><tbody>{measurementMethods.map(([feature,method,agreement])=><tr><th scope="row">{feature}</th><td data-label="Method">{method}</td><td data-label="Agree for the drawing">{agreement}</td></tr>)}</tbody></table>
  </section>
  <section class="fd-section" id="inspection-process" aria-labelledby="inspection-process-title"><header class="fd-section-head"><h2 id="inspection-process-title">Checks at the points that matter</h2><p>Set the check points and approval responsibilities for the order. A sample hold point applies when agreed in advance.</p></header><ol class="fd-inspection-flow">{inspectionStages.map(stage=><li><h3>{stage.title}</h3><p>{stage.text}</p><p class="fd-stage-agreement">{stage.agreement}</p></li>)}</ol></section>
  <section class="fd-section" id="inspection-records" aria-labelledby="records-title"><header class="fd-records-head"><div><h2 id="records-title">The records are part of the order</h2><p>Agree report formats, sampling and approval stages before production. Each dimensional report should connect the measured result to the part, drawing revision and acceptance limits.</p></div><nav class="fd-actions" aria-label="Inspection documents"><a class="fd-link" href={reportHref}>Request a relevant sample report</a><a class="fd-link" href="/downloads/order-acceptance-checklist.txt" download>Download acceptance checklist</a></nav></header><table class="fd-table fd-record-table" id="order-documentation"><thead><tr><th scope="col">Record</th><th scope="col">Specify the content</th><th scope="col">Identify & agree</th></tr></thead><tbody>{orderRecords.map(([record,content,reference])=><tr><th scope="row">{record}</th><td data-label="Specify the content">{content}</td><td data-label="Identify & agree">{reference}</td></tr>)}</tbody></table></section>
  <section class="fd-section fd-qualification" id="quality-management" aria-labelledby="qualification-title"><div><h2 id="qualification-title">Review the supplier documents</h2><p>LZZ is ISO 9001 certified. Request the current certificate, scope and relevant inspection documentation for your qualification process.</p><FactoryPhoto id="cmm-detail" caption="CMM probe and fixture · original LZZ photograph" sizes="(max-width:760px) 180px, 210px"/></div><div><dl class="fd-simple-list">{qualificationFields.map(([title,text])=><div><dt>{title}</dt><dd>{text}</dd></div>)}</dl><a class="fd-link" href={qualificationHref}>Request the ISO certificate</a><p class="fd-small">Equipment photographs show the inspection setting. Current calibration evidence, report availability and the agreed checks are confirmed for your project.</p></div></section>
  <span id="prepare-email" class="fd-anchor"/>
  <RfqPanel title="Set the acceptance plan before machining" description="Mark critical features and tell us which checks and records your project needs." href={quoteHref} contained><div slot="details" class="fd-rfq-details"><div><h3>Include with your drawing</h3><ul><li>Part number, units and drawing revision</li><li>Critical features, datums and acceptance limits</li><li>Material, finishing and measurement condition</li><li>Sampling, reports and approval responsibilities</li></ul></div><p>Need to understand the production setting as well? <a class="fd-link" href="/factory/workshop/">Visit the workshop</a></p></div></RfqPanel>
 </div>
</article>
</Layout>
